      <h2>Our Shower Installation Service. Start to Finish.</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">Here is what to expect from our shower installation service. Start to finish, in one visit for most jobs.</p>
      <div class="pf-steps" style="margin-top:2rem;">
        <div class="pf-step"><div class="pf-step-num">1</div><div><strong>Free quote visit</strong><p>We come to your Liverpool home for a free quote visit. We look at your water supply, the bathroom layout and what you want. We give you a written fixed-price quote on the day.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-step"><div class="pf-step-num">2</div><div><strong>Prep the area</strong><p>On the day of the fit, we shut off the water and the power to the bathroom. We protect the floor and the work area. We strip out the old shower or get the new spot ready.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-step"><div class="pf-step-num">3</div><div><strong>Plumbing and electrical in parallel</strong><p>The plumber runs the hot and cold pipework to the new valve. The Part P electrician runs the power cable to electric showers. Both trades work in parallel. The day moves fast.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-step"><div class="pf-step-num">4</div><div><strong>Fit and seal</strong><p>The valve, the head, the riser rail and the screen all go in. The trays and enclosures get set level. Silicone is applied. We always test for leaks before we close anything up.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-step"><div class="pf-step-num">5</div><div><strong>Test, set up and hand over</strong><p>Water back on. Power back on. We run the shower at full flow and check the temperature. We balance the hot and cold. We hand you the user guide. You get a one-month follow-up call.</p></div></div>
